blocks.en:
Table 1 : Main results (%) on safe and unsafe images across four systems.
Safe Over-Refusal (SOR) = block rate on benign edits (lower is better);
Unsafe Intent Refusal (UIR) = block rate on unsafe-intent edits (higher is better);
Unsafe Neutral Refusal (UNR) = block rate on neutral edits on unsafe images (higher is better).
These three metrics use Block = Refuse+Error; the individual columns show how each system implements its safety decisions.

